+#
+# RTX Spark board with 2x RT1320 (uid 0x30/0x31) on link 0 and RT712
+# on link 1. Speakers and internal microphones board-validated by
+# acoustic loopback (440 Hz tone via speakers captured by the DMICs).
+# PCMs: 0=speakers 1=jack 8=UL1 capture.
+# UL1 pairing on this board: SimpleJack BE = PDI12/DP12 + O020 I178/O021
+# I179; SmartMic BE = PDI13/DP13 + O020 I180/O021 I181 (rt712 SDCA DMIC).
+# Note: the RT1320 output unmute latches only while a stream is running
